# Manifest note
#
# This lane was published through the connected GitHub contents API. A complete
# content-hash manifest cannot be truthfully generated without reading every
# final remote blob after publication. The lane therefore records file-level
# integrity through Git blob SHAs exposed by GitHub and leaves cryptographic
# SHA-256 recomputation as a final follow-up gate rather than fabricating values.
#
# Required substantive paths are enumerated in FINAL-RECEIPT.md.
